flowchart TD

    %% =====================================
    %% PRODUCT SETUP
    %% =====================================

    Product[Product]

    Product --> Variant

    Variant[Product Variant]

    Variant --> InventoryRecord

    InventoryRecord[Inventory Record]

    %% =====================================
    %% INVENTORY MODEL
    %% =====================================

    InventoryRecord --> AvailableStock
    InventoryRecord --> ReservedStock

    AvailableStock[Available Quantity]
    ReservedStock[Reserved Quantity]

    %% =====================================
    %% CUSTOMER PURCHASE FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Customer[👤 Customer]

    Customer --> ProductPage

    ProductPage[Product Detail Page]

    ProductPage --> AddToCart

    AddToCart[Add To Cart]

    AddToCart --> Checkout

    Checkout[Checkout Started]

    %% =====================================
    %% INVENTORY VALIDATION
    %% =====================================

    Checkout --> InventoryValidation

    InventoryValidation[Inventory Validation]

    InventoryValidation --> StockAvailable
    InventoryValidation --> StockUnavailable

    StockAvailable[Inventory Available]
    StockUnavailable[Out Of Stock]

    StockUnavailable --> CheckoutFailed

    CheckoutFailed[Checkout Rejected]

    %% =====================================
    %% INVENTORY RESERVATION
    %% =====================================

    StockAvailable --> InventoryReservation

    InventoryReservation[Reserve Inventory]

    InventoryReservation --> ReserveUpdate

    ReserveUpdate[Move Quantity To Reserved Stock]

    ReserveUpdate --> ReservationCreated

    ReservationCreated[Reservation Active]

    %% =====================================
    %% PAYMENT FLOW
    %% =====================================

    ReservationCreated --> PaymentProcessing

    PaymentProcessing[Payment Processing]

    PaymentProcessing --> PaymentSuccess
    PaymentProcessing --> PaymentFailed

    PaymentSuccess[Payment Successful]
    PaymentFailed[Payment Failed]

    %% =====================================
    %% PAYMENT FAILURE
    %% =====================================

    PaymentFailed --> ReleaseReservation

    ReleaseReservation[Release Reserved Inventory]

    ReleaseReservation --> RestoreAvailable

    RestoreAvailable[Restore Available Quantity]

    %% =====================================
    %% PAYMENT SUCCESS
    %% =====================================

    PaymentSuccess --> OrderConfirmed

    OrderConfirmed[Order Confirmed]

    OrderConfirmed --> FinalInventoryDeduction

    FinalInventoryDeduction[Consume Reserved Inventory]

    FinalInventoryDeduction --> InventoryUpdated

    InventoryUpdated[Inventory Updated]

    %% =====================================
    %% CANCELLATION FLOW
    %% =====================================

    OrderConfirmed --> OrderCancelled

    OrderCancelled[Order Cancelled]

    OrderCancelled --> InventoryRestore

    InventoryRestore[Return Quantity To Inventory]

    InventoryRestore --> AvailableStock

    %% =====================================
    %% RETURN FLOW
    %% =====================================

    DeliveredOrder[Delivered Order]

    DeliveredOrder --> ReturnRequested

    ReturnRequested[Return Requested]

    ReturnRequested --> ReturnApproved
    ReturnRequested --> ReturnRejected

    ReturnApproved[Return Approved]

    ReturnApproved --> WarehouseInspection

    WarehouseInspection[Warehouse Inspection]

    WarehouseInspection --> Restock
    WarehouseInspection --> Discard

    Restock[Return To Inventory]

    Restock --> AvailableStock

    Discard[Damaged / Unsellable]

    %% =====================================
    %% OVERSOLD PREVENTION
    %% =====================================

    InventoryValidation --> AtomicUpdate

    AtomicUpdate[Atomic Inventory Update]

    AtomicUpdate --> RowLock

    RowLock[Database Row Lock]

    RowLock --> InventoryReservation

    %% =====================================
    %% RESERVATION EXPIRY
    %% =====================================

    ReservationCreated --> ReservationTimeout

    ReservationTimeout[Reservation Expired]

    ReservationTimeout --> ReleaseReservation

    %% =====================================
    %% INVENTORY AUDIT
    %% =====================================

    InventoryReservation --> AuditLog

    FinalInventoryDeduction --> AuditLog

    InventoryRestore --> AuditLog

    Restock --> AuditLog

    AuditLog[Inventory Audit Log]

    AuditLog --> BeforeQuantity

    AuditLog --> AfterQuantity

    AuditLog --> ChangeReason

    BeforeQuantity[Before Quantity]
    AfterQuantity[After Quantity]
    ChangeReason[Reason Code]

    %% =====================================
    %% MONITORING
    %% =====================================

    InventoryUpdated --> Metrics

    ReservationCreated --> Metrics

    StockUnavailable --> Metrics

    Metrics[Inventory Metrics]

    Metrics --> Dashboard

    Dashboard[Inventory Dashboard]

    %% =====================================
    %% STORAGE LAYER
    %% =====================================

    InventoryRecord --> MySQL

    MySQL[(MySQL)]

    InventoryValidation --> Redis

    Redis[(Redis Cache)]